        },
        {
          "text": " Hezekia yaayakiira ebaruha eyaareetwa ezo ntumwa, yaagishoma; bwanyima yainamuka, yaija omu nju ya MUKAMA, yaagishashaanura omu maisho ge. ",
          "type": "text",
