        },
        {
          "text": " Hezekia yaashabira omu maisho ga MUKAMA naagira ati: Ai MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli, otuura aha kitebe ky'obukama ahagati ya baakerubi, Iwe wenka niiwe Ruhanga ow'obugabe bwona obw'omu nsi; niiwe waahangire eiguru n'ensi. ",
          "type": "text",
