        {
          "text": "Bwanyima Isaaya mwene Amozi yaatuma ahari Hezekia naagira ati: Oku nikwo MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli arikugamba naagira ati: Nk'oku onshabire kukuhwera aha bya Senakeribu omugabe wa Asiria, naakwikiriza. ",
